# Heavy binary assets: Blender sources, their .blend1 autosaves and the
# downloaded Z-Anatomy archives. Moved out of public/ into assets-src/ so Vite
# never copies ~900 MB into a production build. They are still needed offline to
# generate the anatomical lexicon, so they are ignored, not deleted.
# Revisit with Git LFS if they ever need to be versioned or mirrored.
assets-src/
*.blend
*.blend1
*.zip

